Root cause:
The bug was related to inconsistencies in the way help text was generated for commands within the server, particularly after a change that removed the method responsible for reloading the help text. This caused issues with displaying the help text correctly after certain commands were executed, leading users to experience a lack of proper guidance when using the '/help' command. The fix involved replacing the removed `reloadText` method with a uniform implementation of `getHelpText` across different command classes to ensure consistent and accurate help text generation.
